{"id":"bd9e54d7eced70db","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-tree9-superperfect-tree.md","title":"ZFC Tree9 Superperfect Tree","display":"df-zfc-tree9-superperfect-tree — ZFC Tree9 Superperfect Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree9-superperfect-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree9-superperfect-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree9-superperfect-tree — ZFC Tree9 Superperfect Tree","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-tree8-miller-tree.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree9-superperfect-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree9-superperfect-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree9-superperfect-tree — ZFC Tree9 Superperfect Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"028c35c6c49fa960\" href=\"?note=028c35c6c49fa960\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-tree8-miller-tree.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-tree8-miller-tree.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in V\">\\(T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8MillerTree}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree9SuperperfectTree}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8MillerTree}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree9SuperperfectTree}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"028c35c6c49fa960\" href=\"?note=028c35c6c49fa960\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-tree8-miller-tree.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-tree8-miller-tree.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}superperfect\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9SuperperfectTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8MillerTree}_S(T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}superperfect\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9SuperperfectTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8MillerTree}_S(T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 上的树，superperfect 与 Miller 条件相同：树被修剪，且每个节点都延伸到具有无穷多个直接后继的节点。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-tree8-miller-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"028c35c6c49fa960","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-tree8-miller-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-tree8-miller-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"028c35c6c49fa960","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8MillerTree}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree9SuperperfectTree}_S\\subseteq V$（见 [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-tree8-miller-tree.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8MillerTree}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree9SuperperfectTree}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}superperfect\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9SuperperfectTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarr